2. Create a new NestJS application using `nest new logging-service`.
3. Replace the contents of the specified files with the provided code.
4. Run `npm install` to install the necessary dependencies.
5. Start the application using `npm run start`.
6. The application will be accessible at `http://0.0.0.0:5000`.

